  "body": "\n### Fixed\n\n- **format**: preserve Markdown containers and add opt-in checks ([3b9de26](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/commit/3b9de26eda11acd7dc2a01913d68ff7408898ec2))\n- **MD052**: validate reference labels and definitions ([0ce09f7](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/commit/0ce09f718dd8b27847f9e54405ecb13c9856a73b))\n- **MD007**: track separate lists after ordered items ([ec1c96d](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/commit/ec1c96dd591ee66b4cf80bdb98cfb2f3192e9724))\n- **md044**: accept every configured casing of a proper name ([b44da24](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/commit/b44da2411de74e94c00b95407313fee9e3ee7102))\n\n\n## Downloads\n\n| File | Platform | Checksum |\n|------|----------|----------|\n| [rumdl-v0.3.7-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/releases/download/v0.3.7/rumdl-v0.3.7-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz) | Linux x86_64 | [checksum](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/releases/download/v0.3.7/rumdl-v0.3.7-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz.sha256) |\n| [rumdl-v0.3.7-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/releases/download/v0.3.7/rumdl-v0.3.7-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz) | Linux x86_64 (musl) | [checksum](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/releases/download/v0.3.7/rumdl-v0.3.7-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz.sha256) |\n| [rumdl-v0.3.7-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/releases/download/v0.3.7/rumdl-v0.3.7-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz) | Linux ARM64 | [checksum](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/releases/download/v0.3.7/rumdl-v0.3.7-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz.sha256) |\n| [rumdl-v0.3.7-aarch64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/releases/download/v0.3.7/rumdl-v0.3.7-aarch64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz) | Linux ARM64 (musl) | [checksum](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/releases/download/v0.3.7/rumdl-v0.3.7-aarch64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz.sha256) |\n| [rumdl-v0.3.7-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.gz](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/releases/download/v0.3.7/rumdl-v0.3.7-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.gz) | macOS x86_64 | [checksum](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/releases/download/v0.3.7/rumdl-v0.3.7-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.gz.sha256) |\n| [rumdl-v0.3.7-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.gz](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/releases/download/v0.3.7/rumdl-v0.3.7-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.gz) | macOS ARM64 (Apple Silicon) | [checksum](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/releases/download/v0.3.7/rumdl-v0.3.7-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.gz.sha256) |\n| [rumdl-v0.3.7-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/releases/download/v0.3.7/rumdl-v0.3.7-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip) | Windows x86_64 | [checksum](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/releases/download/v0.3.7/rumdl-v0.3.7-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip.sha256) |\n\n## Installation\n\n### Using uv (Recommended)\n```bash\nuv tool install rumdl\n```\n\n### Using pip\n```bash\npip install rumdl\n```\n\n### Using pipx\n```bash\npipx install rumdl\n```\n\n### Direct Download\nDownload the appropriate binary for your platform from the table above, extract it, and add it to your PATH.\n",
